Third-party material
--------------------

Decolab does not ship the software it installs. Pi-hole, Unbound, Immich,
Vaultwarden, Portainer, Prometheus, Perses, Uptime Kuma and the other services
are pulled as container images from their publishers and remain under their
own licenses. Their names are used only to say what Decolab sets up; Decolab
is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of these projects.

Bundled third-party files are listed below with origin and license. Every file
added to this repository that was not written for Decolab must get an entry
here before it is committed.

  panel/static/fonts/cinzel-600.woff2
    Cinzel, weight 600 (subset), by The Cinzel Project Authors
    (https://github.com/NDISCOVER/Cinzel).
    SIL Open Font License 1.1; full text in panel/static/fonts/OFL.txt.

The panel's logo (panel/static/icons/eqv-logo.webp, eqv-ring.svg, the
